      "writtenOn": "2023-03-01T14:45:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only way these loops won\u0027t terminate is if there\u0027s a loop in the linked list. This would only happen if there was a bug in my implementation. Without formal verification, I can\u0027t guarantee this will never happen.\n\nNone of these while loops should iterate more than `entry_count` times. So I could switch the while loops to for loops, which is slightly less readable.",
